As promised after our meeting, here's an overview of Normain's role/permission model and how SharePoint access works — so you can plan your access provisioning.

**How the roles work:**

* Each user has one **organization-level** role — either **Org owner** or **Org manager**.

* For every team they belong to, a user has one **team-level** role — either **Team owner** or **Team member**.

* The four role columns below are therefore two either/or choices: one per org, one per team.

